CHANGES IN VERSION 1.14.0
-------------------------

    o fix `RunPCA()` on Seurat Assay5 objects with DelayedMatrix layers,
      which failed with Seurat (>= 5.6.0); new `RunPCA.Assay5()`,
      `RunICA.Assay5()` and `RunSLSI.Assay5()`

    o fix `scNewSeuratGDS()` when the GDS file has assays other than
      "counts" and "logcounts"


